# Secluded Starforge's "{2}, {T}, Tap X untapped artifacts you control: Target creature gets +X/+0 until end of turn."
# X is announced as it is activated (CR 107.3a, 601.2b by way of 602.2b), and can't be more than the untapped artifacts
# Bot1 controls (three: two Memnites and Ornithopter), so 4 is refused. X is 2: the two Islands' {U}{U} pay the {2}
# with the pool left empty; Bot2's Phyrexian Walker, an artifact Bot1 doesn't control, can't be tapped for it; the two
# Memnites are tapped (CR 118.3), and Starforge itself for {T}. Ornithopter, Bot1's own, is 2/2 until end of turn: +2
# power, its toughness unchanged (CR 611.2a); on turn 6 it is 0/2 again (CR 514.2).

